<title>USA: Dow Jones stake held by New York firm.</title>
<headline>Dow Jones stake held by New York firm.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sanford Bernstein &amp; Co Inc, based in New York, said in a Securities and Exchange Commission filing Thursday it holds a 5.2 percent stake in Dow Jones &amp; Co, or 4,990,960 common shares.</p>
<p>Bernstein disclosed its latest position on Dow Jones in a 13G filing.</p>
<p>Filings under 13G are usually made by institutions and large investors with &quot;passive&quot; investment objectives in a company. Unlike 13D filings, those reports do not list the latest transactions.</p>
</text>
